      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid solidification of Hf-Mo-Ta-Ti-Zr will induce a fine lamellar microstructure.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6427779::rubric_mechanisms::001::d042c5afce"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Solution heat treatment can produce a disordered BCC matrix with controlled B2 precipitation in Hf-Mo-Ta-Ti-Zr.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC5995863::rubric_mechanisms::003::4992b97321"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed processing route can avoid brittle topologically close-packed phases.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A high cooling rate limits grain and dendrite growth.",
      "field": "conditions",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6427779::rubric_mechanisms::001::d042c5afce"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Hard ordered B2 regions will pin dislocations moving through the soft disordered BCC matrix.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::000::3906a5e634"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "B2-mediated dislocation pinning will generate significant work hardening and high ductility despite high strength.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::000::3906a5e634",
        "PMC4145285::rubric_mechanisms::004::c8d3e6cdd4"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Rapid solidification will provide the fine BCC/B2 spacing required for the proposed strengthening and ductilization mechanism.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC6427779::rubric_mechanisms::001::d042c5afce"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed Hf-Mo-Ta-Ti-Zr BCC matrix will have a Pugh ratio K/G greater than 1.75 and positive Cauchy pressure.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A Pugh ratio above 1.75 and positive Cauchy pressure are empirical indicators of intrinsic ductility.",
      "field": "mechanism",
